{"title":"Mummy","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 46 Mummy that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 5 times (2.1% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: reviveHpFraction: .25</p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/mummy\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>55</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>56</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=46\">Lv 46 <span>22</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=47\">Lv 47 <span>41</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>36</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>3</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=44\" title=\"Pick level 44\"><td><b>44</b></td><td>233</td><td>28.7</td><td>2,200</td><td class=\"muted\">699 · 40.2 · 6,600</td><td>55</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b>45</b></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>56</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=46\" title=\"Pick level 46\"><td><b>46</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>254</td><td>29.8</td><td>2,300</td><td class=\"muted\">762 · 41.7 · 6,900</td><td>22</td><td>in the wilds around 2006, 910</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=47\" title=\"Pick level 47\"><td><b>47</b></td><td>266</td><td>30.4</td><td>2,350</td><td class=\"muted\">798 · 42.6 · 7,050</td><td>41</td><td>in the wilds around 2007, 908</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=48\" title=\"Pick level 48\"><td><b>48</b></td><td>278</td><td>30.9</td><td>2,400</td><td class=\"muted\">834 · 43.3 · 7,200</td><td>36</td><td>in the wilds around 2062, 898</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=50\" title=\"Pick level 50\"><td><b>50</b></td><td>303</td><td>32</td><td>2,500</td><td class=\"muted\">909 · 44.8 · 7,500</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Sun King&#39;s Tomb</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 29</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-192\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 40 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2004, 905 <span class=\"muted\">· 16 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2061, 892 <span class=\"muted\">· 14 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Avenue\">Sunken Avenue</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 12 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sun%20King's%20Tomb\">Sun King&#39;s Tomb</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 12 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1822, 1033 <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"mummy\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(2)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/the-hollow-herald\"><img src=\"data/img/a272b34a0b2a37171a72.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>The Hollow Herald</b><span>Lv 44</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/the-sun-king\"><img src=\"data/img/a272b34a0b2a37171a72.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>The Sun King</b><span>Lv 50</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Mummy: <a href=\"#/monster/withered-husk\">Withered Husk</a> <span class=\"muted\">(43)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/embalmed-priest\">Embalmed Priest</a> <span class=\"muted\">(49)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/a272b34a0b2a37171a72.webp\" alt=\"Mummy\"></div><h3>Mummy</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>46 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 0–50)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Mummy</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>254</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>29.8</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2300</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.2 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr